# CRITICAL: sibling Next.js apps live alongside the marketing hub in
# this monorepo (each has its own src/app/). If they end up inside
# the Docker build context, Turbopack compiles their pages alongside
# the marketing hub and they collide on shared route names — most
# visibly /login → renders the teletherapy login (with "SCEI
# Teletherapy" branding) instead of "Operations Hub".
#
# Keep these excluded so Turbopack only sees the marketing hub source
# tree at ./src and ./public.
teletherapy
client-portal
accounting-hub
verdana-store

# DB + uploads backup tarballs pile up to many GB on the VPS — never
# include them in the build context (they crashed the build with
# "no space left on device" when the dir grew past 10GB).
backups
